BT /F2 20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 750.00 Tm (Enana App Summary) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 726.00 Tm (Enana is an Electron desktop app for lab workflow management that combines records, notebooks, inventory, assay and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 715.00 Tm (gel analysis, papers, and an agent chat surface in one interface.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 701.00 Tm (The repo shows a multi-module workstation with local state persistence, JSON file save/load, and optional LLM and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 690.00 Tm (Telegram integrations.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 676.00 Tm (Who It Is For) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 662.00 Tm (Primary persona: lab members running wet-lab workflows, based on repo modules for members, instruments,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 651.00 Tm (protocols, synthesis and biology notebooks, samples, assays, gels, chemicals, and papers.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 637.00 Tm (What It Does) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 623.00 Tm (- Manages lab members, projects, workflows, and protocol records.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 611.00 Tm (- Schedules instruments and reservations with calendar views.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 599.00 Tm (- Maintains synthesis and biology notebook entries linked to project context.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 587.00 Tm (- Tracks chemicals, personal inventory, and sample registry records.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 575.00 Tm (- Supports assay result handling and gel analysis workflows.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 563.00 Tm (- Stores papers and can turn extracted methods into protocol drafts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 551.00 Tm (- Provides an agent chat UI plus optional Telegram bot controls.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 537.00 Tm (How It Works) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 523.00 Tm (- Electron main process \(`main.js`\) creates the desktop window, handles file dialogs, auto-save/load, agent) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 512.00 Tm (  requests, and Telegram bot lifecycle.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 500.00 Tm (- A preload bridge \(`preload.js`\) exposes a narrow IPC API to the renderer for storage, agent chat, and Telegram) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 489.00 Tm (  actions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 477.00 Tm (- The renderer \(`renderer.js`\) initializes domain modules from `modules/` and coordinates cross-module refreshes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 465.00 Tm (- Client state lives in browser `localStorage` via `modules/shared.js`; the app can also persist/load a JSON or `.ena`) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 454.00 Tm (  data file.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 442.00 Tm (- Optional data flow: renderer sends agent prompts to the main process, which calls an LLM endpoint; Telegram) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 431.00 Tm (  commands are forwarded into the renderer.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 417.00 Tm (How To Run) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 403.00 Tm (- Install dependencies: `npm install`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 391.00 Tm (- Run the app in development: `npm run start`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 379.00 Tm (- Optional check: `npm test`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 367.00 Tm (- Build installers/packages: `npm run dist` or `npm run package:app`.) Tj ET
